# Route: guide 12 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 33 to
# 36, 45 quests, 3.8 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Ironforge, Stormwind City, Hillsbrad Foothills, Dustwallow Marsh):
# near Ironforge -> Ironforge -> near Ironforge -> near Stormwind City -> near
# Stormwind -> near Stormwind City -> near Stormwind -> Stormwind ->
# Southshore -> Western Strand -> Southshore -> Western Strand -> Southshore
# -> ….
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 1578 Supplying
# the Front; 1618 Gearing Redridge; 3629 Goblin Engineering; 3632 Gnome
# Engineering; 3640 The Pledge of Secrecy; 3641 Show Your Work; 3647
# Membership Card Renewal; 5283 The Art of the Armorsmith; 5284 The Way of the
# Weaponsmith; 6609 I Got Nothin' Left!; 6612 I Know A Guy...; 6625 Alliance
# Trauma; 96045 Camping 101: Alchemy; 96059 Camping 101: Enchanting; 6607 Nat
# Pagle, Angler Extreme; 6624 Triage.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Knowledge in the Deeps (971), Knowledge in the Deeps
# (971), Mythology of the Titans (1050), Mythology of the Titans (1050), The
# Lost Tablets of Will (1139), Back to Uldaman (2200), Restoring the Necklace
